Package: alma-scanner
Version: 1.0-6
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Joshua Hanlin AlmaAutomation@proton.me
Description: Alma Scanner - FastAPI backend + React frontend for binary detection
 This installs Alma Scanner under /opt/alma-scanner and starts a systemd service
 using a locally-created Python virtual environment.
Depends: python3, python3-venv, python3-pip, systemd
